That is reproduced as-is rather than corrected, per the no-bug-fixing requirement. On matching failure or EOF ([38;5;10m""[0m, [38;5;10mabc[0m, [38;5;10m-[0m, [38;5;10m0x1f[0m) [38;5;10mx[0m keeps its initial [38;5;10m0[0m, since the C ignores [38;5;10mscanf[0m's return value.[0m[0m
